+来源：[`packages/skill/skills-manager/src/tools.ts`](../packages/skill/skills-manager/src/tools.ts)
+
+### `skills_manager_remove`
+
+删除一个受管 agent skill。它会立即从技能目录中消失，存储的条目也会被删除。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {
+    "name": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Kebab-case skill name: lowercase letters, digits, and single hyphens (for example \"release-notes\"). The model loads the skill by this exact name."
+    }
+  },
+  "required": [
+    "name"
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/skill/skills-manager/src/tools.ts`](../packages/skill/skills-manager/src/tools.ts)
+
+### `skills_manager_set_enabled`
+
+在不删除的前提下启用或停用受管 agent skill。停用会把它从技能目录中撤下，但保留已存正文；启用会重新发布它。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {
+    "name": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Kebab-case skill name: lowercase letters, digits, and single hyphens (for example \"release-notes\"). The model loads the skill by this exact name."
+    },
+    "enabled": {
+      "type": "boolean",
+      "description": "True to publish the skill, false to withdraw it."
+    }
+  },
+  "required": [
+    "name",
+    "enabled"
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/skill/skills-manager/src/tools.ts`](../packages/skill/skills-manager/src/tools.ts)
